<title>USA: Electronic Designs Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Electronic Designs Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBOROUGH, Mass. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>ELECTRONIC DESIGNS, INC.</p>
<p>		(Amounts in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			  (Unaudited)</p>
<p>					 Three months ended  Year ended</p>
<p>					   September 30,  September 30,</p>
<p>					1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Revenues			$13,408     $474  $58,654   $1,639</p>
<p> Cost of revenues(A)	   8,892	437   41,705    1,356</p>
<p>   Gross profit		  4,516	 37   16,949	283</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	    1,293  ( 1,337)   2,808  ( 4,158)</p>
<p> Net income (loss) per share  0.15  ( 0.42)     0.38  ( 1.29)</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>  shares and equivalents     9,792    3,197    9,795    3,226</p>
<p>NOTE:  Actual results of operations above include the results of EDI-MA from the date of acquisition (October 10, 1995). (A) Actual cost of revenues for the year ended September 30, 1996 include $1.1 million related to the upward revaluation of inventories acquired from EDI-MA to their estimated fair value as of the acquisition date.</p>
